WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Measure. Use projected area to turn population counts into comparable densities.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Scale. Log transforms and standardization reduce domination by feature units and large values.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Learn. Group similar feature vectors; cluster numbers are category IDs.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Check. Compare maps, scatter and correlations before assigning meaning to groups.
